.TH KDE-AI 1 "2026" "kde-ai 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
kde-ai \- local KDE/CachyOS AI agent CLI
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B kde-ai
[\fB\-\-json\fR]
.RI [ command ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Talks to the per-user
.B kde-ai-agent
daemon over
.I $XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/kde-ai/kde-ai.sock .
Privileged tools prompt with sudo on a TTY. Passwords never enter RPC.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
(none)
Interactive REPL.
.TP
.B chat [--fix] [-s ID] message
Send a chat turn. \fB--fix\fR enters issue mode.
.TP
.B sessions list|new|rename|delete|archive|use
Session CRUD.
.TP
.B memory clear|summarize|pins|pin|unpin|solved|forget|stats|export
Per-session memory.
.TP
.B confirm yes|no [--note]
Solve-loop confirmation.
.TP
.B cancel-attempt
Undo the open attempt.
.TP
.B status / doctor [--reindex] / tools / skills / config / bug-report
Daemon diagnostics and configuration.
.SH SEE ALSO
kde-ai-agent(1)
